"P2199086303" "Arms Shipment"
// DetailString :
"P2932573937" "It all started with a request by Arachnos Operative Wellman to prevent a Wyvern interception of an arms shipment to Paragon City. Traveling to the cargo ship, you repelled the Wyvern attack, allowing the shipment to get to the mainland."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EpisodeTwoClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3810660805" "Boomtown Destruction"
// DetailString :
"P3141891889" "It all started with a request by Arachnos Operative Wellman to prevent a Wyvern interception of an arms shipment to Paragon City. Traveling to the cargo ship, you repelled the Wyvern attack, allowing the shipment to get to the mainland.<br><br>The next step was to put a serious damper on the Boomtown reconstruction efforts. Traveling to Paragon City, you destroyed all the supplies in a reconstruction project causing a serious resource drain."

