// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P773942917" "Sledge Hammer"
// tDetailString :
"P3135099023" "This is a heavy, well-used sledgehammer. You picked it up during a tale you call:<br><br>Master of Destruction<br><br>It all started with a request by Arachnos Operative Wellman to prevent a Wyvern interception of an arms shipment to Paragon City. Traveling to the cargo ship, you repelled the Wyvern attack, allowing the shipment to get to the mainland.<br><br>The next step was to put a serious damper on the Boomtown reconstruction efforts. Traveling to Paragon City, you destroyed all the supplies in a reconstruction project causing a serious resource drain.<br><br>Finally, it was time to put a hurt on the Paragon's pride - it's heroes. You traveled to Paragon City and destroyed a number of statues belonging to prominent heroes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3657598418" "Arachnos supports the efforts of certain rebellious factions in Paragon City by providing them with arms shipments. Usually, there's enough bureaucracy involved that Longbow can't really get involved. However, that mercenary group known as Wyvern has no such restrictions.<br><br>We recently received word that one of our shipments came under siege by a Wyvern team. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over to the cargo ship and defeat the attacking Wyvern forces</A>."
// AcceptString :
"P4078393213" "Defeat all Wyvern Mercenaries"
// SendOffString :
"P621931102" "Wyvern is a bug that must be crushed by Arachnos."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1413436111" "We can't afford to lose that arms shipment! Head over there now!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4211893365" "You pull up alongside the cargo ship. On board you see Wyvern forces securing the deck."

